bayescompR is an independent implementation written in R. It contains no
source code from Stan, stanc3, Stan Math or CmdStan. The following parts are
derived from data or text of those projects:

  R/sysdata.rda (built by data-raw/stan_signatures.R): the table of function
  signatures printed by `stanc --dump-stan-math-signatures` (stanc3 2.40).

  R/pedantic.R: the texts of the warnings of `stanc --warn-pedantic` and
  `stanc --warn-uninitialized` (stanc3 2.40).

  R/diagnostics.R and R/csv.R: the layout and texts of the reports of
  CmdStan's `bin/stansummary` and `bin/diagnose` and of the CmdStan CSV
  and JSON output files (CmdStan 2.40).

The BUGS engine (R/bugs_*.R) contains no source code from JAGS, OpenBUGS,
MultiBUGS or NIMBLE. The distributions, functions and their
parameterizations follow the user manuals of JAGS 5.0, OpenBUGS 3.2.3 and
NIMBLE 1.x. The table of alternative parameter names of NIMBLE
distributions (`.bugs_named` in R/bugs_codegen.R) follows NIMBLE's
distribution definitions; NIMBLE is copyright Perry de Valpine, Christopher
Paciorek, Daniel Turek and others, distributed under the BSD 3-Clause
License reproduced below.

